  "strengths": [
    "Sub-millisecond reads and writes from RAM with rich data structures (sorted sets, streams, HyperLogLog)",
    "Redis 8 bundles vector search, JSON and time series in the core server",
    "Every language has a mature client and every cloud has a compatible managed service",
    "Streams with consumer groups double as a lightweight durable queue",
    "Huge operational knowledge base: patterns for rate limiting, locks, leaderboards"
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
    "Dataset must fit in memory; RAM is the dominant cost at scale",
    "Mostly single-threaded command execution caps per-shard throughput",
    "Redis 8 licenses (AGPLv3/RSAL/SSPL) are a blocker for some legal teams",
    "MULTI/EXEC is not a rollback-capable ACID transaction",
    "Async replication can lose acknowledged writes on failover"
  ],
  "useCases": [
